# Astrid Dev

<!-- vision-statement:start -->
**A tool to unlock the collective artistic ambition of the open-source AI community.**
<!-- vision-statement:end -->

We're building an open creative environment that people and agents can shape together.

This is the workspace where we organise that endeavour — from our shared ambitions to the things we build and ship.

Looking to create with Astrid? Visit [astrid.haus](https://astrid.haus).

## Explore what we're building

